{"id":93,"doub_id":93,"title":"鹬 Piper","years":"2016","class":"动画","image":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2388018826.webp","doub_score":9.4,"IMDB_number":"tt5613056","IMDB_score":null,"edit":"艾伦·巴利拉罗","bianji":"[\"艾伦·巴利拉罗\",\"艾伦·巴利拉罗\"]","performer":"","language":"无对白","release":"2016-06-17(美国)","alias":"小鹬初登场(台)、派珀历险记、鸟瞰世界、鹞、Yù","abstract":"晨曦微茫的小岛上，海水轻柔俯视着纤尘不染的沙滩。伴随着浪花的涌动，浮游生物、海藻、海螺、扇贝等海洋生命搁浅在陆地之上，等待它们的则是饥肠辘辘的捕食者。矶鹬（sandpiper）三五成群，鸣叫着落在了湿漉漉的沙滩上，啄食着可口的扇贝。许是经过了多年的历练，每当新一波潮水涌过来时，它们便第一时间轻盈地躲开，绝不会沾湿半根羽毛。不远处的灌木丛里，一只破壳未久的小矶鹬窥伺着父母的一举一动。少顷，妈妈飞回巢穴，小家伙一如既往张开嘴巴等着喂食，不过妈妈似乎决意要让孩子独立，自顾自将扇贝肉吃到肚子里。没有办法，小矶鹬只能走向海边。然而海水是那么讨厌，一波一波扑向这个未谙世事的小家伙。这时，一个意外突然发生……\n　　本片为《海底总动员2》的贴片动画。 ","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2394386364.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2394304172.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2393602033.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2358518544.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2428423952.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2388018826.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2373241302.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2593898859.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2634533403.webp\"]","myShareurl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1jrcPVWZtPN4PT3kMAkidNA?pwd=kxwa\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-08-07\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":0}]","shareUrl":"[]","ecca":"null","all_seeds":"\"[]\"","duration":"","address":" 美国","orginName":"鹬 Piper","ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 短片\n","tag":"No.2|评分最高短片"}